@startuml

title Join, color selection, and game start

participant Client1
participant Server
participant Client2

group first player enters the waiting room
Client1->Server: JoinGameRequest

alt game exists and has space
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(Player joined, snapshot)
else game does not exist
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(GAME_NOT_FOUND)
else game is full or already started
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(GAME_FULL)
end
end

group color reservation while waiting
Client1->Server: ChooseColorRequest(BLUE)
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(success, snapshot)

Client2->Server: ChooseColorRequest(BLUE)
Server-->Client2: GameOperationResult(COLOR_ALREADY_TAKEN)

Client2->Server: ChooseColorRequest(RED)
Server-->Client2: GameOperationResult(success, snapshot)
end

group last player joins
Client2->Server: JoinGameRequest
Server->Server: create players and start game
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(game starts)
Server-->Client2: GameOperationResult(game starts, snapshot)
end

note over Client1, Client2
A reserved nickname may choose a color before joining.
A joined player may also change color until the game starts.
end note

@enduml
